    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "Look at how it happened. For a decade, two hundred was rare: somewhere between four and eighteen times a season. Then, in twenty twenty-three, it more than doubled, to thirty-seven. Forty-one the year after. Fifty in twenty twenty-five. And sixty-five in twenty twenty-six.",
