  {
   "vo": "By twenty twenty-six, the powerplay had jumped by more than three runs an over, to ten point one. The middle overs rose by two, to nine point three. And the death overs? Up just one point two. In fact, death-over scoring peaked in twenty twenty-four, and it has fallen since.",
   "scene": {
    "type": "stats",
    "head": {
     "t": "2013 → 2026",
     "sub": "CHANGE IN RUNS PER OVER"
    },
    "tiles": [
     {
      "v": "+3.2",
      "l": "POWERPLAY",
      "c": "gold"
     },
     {
