  {
   "vo": "And the fastest of them all in twenty twenty-six? वैभव सूर्यवंशी, still a teenager, scored seven hundred and seventy-six runs at a strike rate of two thirty-seven. अभिषेक शर्मा struck at two oh five. Rajat Patidar, at one ninety-three. These aren't tail-end hitters. They're openers and top-order batters.",
