      "c": "gold"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "For bowlers, it's a different sport. In twenty thirteen, about one over in thirteen went for fifteen runs or more. In twenty twenty-six, it was more than one in six. Tidy overs, six runs or fewer, went from nearly half of all overs, to under a third.",
   "scene": {
