      "29.4%",
      "a"
     ]
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "vo": "Spin used to be the safe option. In twenty thirteen, spinners went for under seven an over, almost a run cheaper than pace. By twenty twenty-six, spinners were going at nine point three, and the gap had shrunk to under seven-tenths of a run.",
